# Optional root-owned configuration. The validator receives no collector token.
#
# Put nothing in this file but the two telemetry arguments below. The direct
# unit expands this variable, unquoted, onto the validator's command line.
# Never add --netuid here. A runtime from before that flag existed rejects it
# and exits with status 2, and the unit never restarts after status 2. An
# update rollback reinstalls exactly such an older runtime, so the validator
# would stop until someone repaired this file by hand.
CATHEDRAL_VALIDATOR_TELEMETRY_ARGS="--telemetry-spool /var/lib/cathedral-validator-telemetry/events.jsonl --telemetry-reader-group cathedral-telemetry"
